          "settings": {
            "text": "About FANN"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "title"
      ]
    },
    "content_0": {
      "type": "fann-editorial",
      "settings": {
        "spacing": 48,
        "background": "#161719",
        "text_color": "#E8E6E0",
        "accent": "#B29C7D"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Confidence begins underneath."
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>FANN is a men\u2019s fashion brand beginning with the first layer: underwear. We believe what you wear closest should support the way you feel, move and express yourself.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
      ]
    },
    "content_1": {
      "type": "fann-editorial",
      "settings": {
        "spacing": 48,
        "background": "#161719",
        "text_color": "#E8E6E0",
        "accent": "#B29C7D"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "A considered foundation."
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our direction brings together clear form, comfort-led design and personal identity. Every line has its own expression, from the restraint of Silver to the narrative character of Legacy.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
      ]
    },
    "content_2": {
      "type": "fann-editorial",
      "settings": {
        "spacing": 48,
        "background": "#161719",
        "text_color": "#E8E6E0",
        "accent": "#B29C7D"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Strength, defined by you."
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Confidence is personal. It can be quiet, deliberate, expressive or resilient. FANN creates space for those differences through a shared design language of structure and considered detail.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
      ]
    },
    "content_3": {
      "type": "fann-editorial",
      "settings": {
        "spacing": 48,
        "background": "#161719",
        "text_color": "#E8E6E0",
        "accent": "#B29C7D"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Designed for Confidence. Engineered for Comfort."
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our promise sets the standard for development: the visual idea must work as a garment. Fit, materials and construction will be evaluated as the concepts become physical products.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
      ]
    },
    "content_4": {
      "type": "fann-editorial",
      "settings": {
        "spacing": 48,
        "background": "#161719",
        "text_color": "#E8E6E0",
        "accent": "#B29C7D"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Support in Style."
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A first layer with purpose. A personal expression, worn close.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
